This fork modifies the original extension and web visualizer. Changes include
syntax-aware Python and JavaScript/TypeScript declaration parsing, YAML
visualization, source navigation, comment visibility, canvas interaction and
persistence, documentation, and release packaging. It is not an upstream release
and is not endorsed by the upstream author.

