Third-party components retain their own licenses and copyright notices.
Complete LGPLv3 and GPLv3 texts accompany the generated LICENSE. The full GPLv3
text is also in COPYING. Runtime dependencies retain their package-local notices.

Microsoft-derived Dark / Dark+ theme styling retains Microsoft's MIT license.
Its full notice and pinned upstream references are preserved in
src/web_visualizer/src/highlightjs/styles/LICENSE and the generated LICENSE.

The inherited general-purpose TextUtils.count snippet has been removed.
Selection source-position handling now counts newline characters directly.

